#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:145
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "DG50CA"
msgstr "3. Use of cookies"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:147
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "4+kTCD"
msgstr "Our site uses strictly necessary cookies that ensure the proper operation of the service and authorization. We do not use advertising or analytical cookies unless you explicitly agree to them."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:152
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "6oB/MV"
msgstr "Necessary cookies ensure the operation of the site and cannot be disabled. These include session cookies (store temporary technical data — your session identifier) and a refresh token cookie used to extend your authorized session without re-entering the SMS code. This cookie is secure and inaccessible to third-party sites."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:159
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "pzGOwm"
msgstr "4. How we use your data"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:160
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "V7wUm6"
msgstr "Your personal data is used exclusively for:"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:162
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "fXS/P9"
msgstr "registration and authorization in the Hermes loyalty program;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:163
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "FSck1+"
msgstr "accrual, storage, and deduction of miles;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:164
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "yGFGA3"
msgstr "operation of the interactive country map and game bonuses;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:165
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "kro8Xk"
msgstr "placing orders in the web store;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:166
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "E0DqTQ"
msgstr "improving the quality of service and customer support."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:169
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "Dl3T8n"
msgstr "We do not transfer your data to third parties, except when necessary for the operation of technological services (SMS sending, simplified admin panel) and only via a secure protocol."

